cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASPHER in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ASPHER: Accelerated SPectral and HiERarchical contact solver"
abstract: >-
  Boundary-element solver for normal and frictional contact of rough elastic
  half-spaces, free-space or doubly periodic: exact Love/Boussinesq and
  Cerruti influence coefficients applied through hierarchical and spectral
  operators (H-matrix ACA, a matrix-free H2/bbFMM, exact FFT convolution),
  a |q| spectral preconditioner, nested-grid continuation and a
  mixed-precision Polonsky-Keer projected conjugate gradient with certified
  stopping.
authors:
  - family-names: Yastrebov
    given-names: Vladislav A.
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cofebem/aspher"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.3
date-released: 2026-09-29
keywords:
  - contact mechanics
  - rough surfaces
  - boundary element method
  - hierarchical matrices
  - fast multipole method
  - tribology
